  "releaseNotes": "Fixes\n\nEvents whose type doesn't bind (#341, closes #320). An event whose delegate type couldn't be resolved, as happens in code being edited (for example System.Action shadowed by a type named System), or an event declared with a non-delegate type, made the generator report IMP005 and drop that target's imposter. With a Debug build of the generator, every imposter of the project was dropped. Such an event is now left out of the imposter, the compiler's own error stays the one to fix, and the rest of the imposter is generated.",
